        </item>
        <item>
         <widget class="QLabel" name="shortcutDescription">
          <property name="text">
             <string>The full project catalog (directional, toggle, and workspace bindings) lists each canonical chord with its current assignment and known/current holders; unavailable queries are reported honestly. Checked rows are kept at their current assignments, unchecked rows are disabled. Authentic stages canonical assignments for enabled bindings; Compatible resets to Keep then disables known-conflicting rows and current holder collisions without replacement chords. Settings Apply never changes shortcuts; use Apply Shortcuts with confirmation. Disabling clears only the project's own assignment. Force Apply appears only for a pending preview that lists every holder with the exact keys removed and kept. Cancel discards the preview without writes. Revert restores KDE defaults for cleared bindings.</string>
          </property>
         <property name="wordWrap">
          <bool>true</bool>
         </property>
        </widget>
       </item>
      </layout>
     </widget>
